License: Apache License, Version 2.0

Oh My Keymint adapts the public reply contract and public-key placeholder in
an independent Rust implementation. It does not bundle upstream C++ code or
prebuilt binaries. The experiment uses simulated responses and cannot provide
real TEE keys, valid cryptographic signatures, or payment authentication.

The Apache License 2.0 is included in AOSP.Apache-license-2.0.txt.
